subject: feat(messages): 3 new view tabs (Timeline/Trace/Board) + facet API + histogram

Implements the multi-view design research (message-viewer-design-philosophies.md):
Messages page now has 5 view tabs — List / Conversations / Timeline / Trace / Board.

NEW VIEWS:
1. Timeline (Messages 2) — trace-style waterfall: request-volume histogram
   (recharts, last 24h, errors red) + per-request latency bars (ttft + total
   segments, status color-coded). CloudWatch/New Relic/GitHub Actions style.
2. Trace (Messages 3) — 3-panel APM tree: conversation list → request chain
   (nodes = requests in session, status dots, errorCategory labels) → detail
   hint. Claude Code trace / Sentry breadcrumbs style.
3. Board (Messages 4) — kanban triage: New/Investigating/Resolved/Snoozed
   columns, cards grouped by fingerprint (provider+model+errorCategory+error),
   drag-and-drop between columns, error category chips + counts. Sentry/Linear
   style. (Column persistence is a P2 item.)

API (/api/messages):
- New sourceApp filter (UA fingerprint class)
- facets: provider/model/status/errorCategory/sourceApp counts over the full
  filtered set (stable across pagination)
- histogram: 24 hourly buckets (count + errors) for the timeline header

FIX: providers/[id]/models/route.js — duplicate `url` declaration broke the
whole build (const url at GET top-level vs let url in same scope). Renamed the
latter to modelsUrl. This was blocking every build.

VERIFICATION (production build, port 20131):
- Timeline: histogram renders (recharts bars), 50 waterfall rows
- Trace: conversation list + request chain + hint panel
- Board: 4 columns, 10 fingerprint-grouped cards, drag works, View opens drawer
- Facet API: provider/model/status/errorCategory/sourceApp counts + 24 histogram buckets

Research: docs/plans-and-prompts/research/message-viewer-design-philosophies.md
Part of: Messages Page + Error Inbox plan (P1 views expansion)

